    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Eat Up the Whole Stage! Chomp &amp; Grow: A Zesty Party Action Game - MASS of GREED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with <strong>Guguri</strong>, monsters born from human greed, to save a planet suffering from an energy crisis! <strong>Open wide and chomp down</strong> on towns and houses to grow massive, and generate tons of energy! Sometimes you'll super-size, other times you'll transform \u2013 just keep on joyfully eating everything in sight!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Devour Every Last Bit!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple button controls, you can <strong>happily gobble up</strong> everything on the stage! <strong>Guguri</strong> get bigger with every tasty bite, so keep on chomping and growing! Stages are procedurally generated, so no two are ever the same! You might discover something new every time you play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play with Friends!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up in 2-player mode and eat together! Cooperate or compete! Experience an exhilarating party action game where desires clash!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Secret of the Lab</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the hidden truth behind the giant corporation that created <strong>Guguri</strong>! You might even find fellow <strong>Guguri</strong> somewhere in the world!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Your Guguri!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the energy you collect to customize your <strong>Guguri</strong>'s appearance and abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is for players who want to enjoy <strong>&quot;time together&quot;</strong> with family and friends, regardless of their gaming skill or age!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*Please note: This game is currently under development. Content may change.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Eat Up the Whole Stage! Chomp &amp; Grow: A Zesty Party Action Game - MASS of GREED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with <strong>Guguri</strong>, monsters born from human greed, to save a planet suffering from an energy crisis! <strong>Open wide and chomp down</strong> on towns and houses to grow massive, and generate tons of energy! Sometimes you'll super-size, other times you'll transform \u2013 just keep on joyfully eating everything in sight!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Devour Every Last Bit!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple button controls, you can <strong>happily gobble up</strong> everything on the stage! <strong>Guguri</strong> get bigger with every tasty bite, so keep on chomping and growing! Stages are procedurally generated, so no two are ever the same! You might discover something new every time you play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play with Friends!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up in 2-player mode and eat together! Cooperate or compete! Experience an exhilarating party action game where desires clash!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Secret of the Lab</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the hidden truth behind the giant corporation that created <strong>Guguri</strong>! You might even find fellow <strong>Guguri</strong> somewhere in the world!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Your Guguri!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the energy you collect to customize your <strong>Guguri</strong>'s appearance and abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is for players who want to enjoy <strong>&quot;time together&quot;</strong> with family and friends, regardless of their gaming skill or age!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*Please note: This game is currently under development. Content may change.</i></p>",
    "short_description": "Become Guguri, a monster that eats anything and everything, and devour the entire stage! With simple controls, gobble up towns and houses to generate massive energy and grow bigger and bigger. Cooperate or compete with friends, then use the collected energy to customize your Guguri!",
